{
  "version": "1.2.7",
  "published": "2026-11-07",
  "changelog": [
    "**Whistles no longer carry across the map.** Every firework sound faded out over the same 700 m, and a whistle is a steady high tone that stands out far beyond its volume, so it was heard long after the booms had gone quiet. Whistles (shells and rockets) now fade out over their own distance, 250 m by default.",
    "**Whistles can be turned off.** Players: Settings > My settings > **Whistles**, or `/holiday fireworks whistle off`. The whole server: Settings > Fireworks > **Whistles**. With them off, a shell leaves with a launch thump.",
    "**Sharper drawn shapes.** The tree, candy cane, snowflake and other shapes drawn in sparks were a blur: the sparks were drawn large with a wide glow, every shape had the same number of them however short its outline (the candy cane was one smear), and their colors alternated spark by spark. Now they are small separate stars spaced along the outline with a faint glow, in one color, or in the shape's own: a red and white striped candy cane, a green tree on a gold trunk, an ice-blue snowflake, a gold bell, a green wreath with a red bow, an orange jack-o'-lantern. The game's own shapes (the star, the heart) are unchanged.",
    "New: `Config.Fireworks.Whistles` (default `true`) and `Config.Fireworks.WhistleRange` (default `250.0`). Nothing to change on upgrade."
  ],
